WEBVTT

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:26.670
Another hot day. A perfect opportunity
to swing by Rabbit House for an iced coffee.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.670
Huh?

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.670
NOW SERVING
CHILLED COFFEE

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.420
"Chilled coffee"?

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.630
Good afternoon!

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.250
Hey! Welcome!

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.540
We've got tasty coffee that's chilled!

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.960
I went to Ama Usa An by mistake!

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.210
No, you didn't!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:10.710
Bunnisode 1:
The Magician at the Cafe of Smiles

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.040
This is the uniform that makes me
feel the most comfortable.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:24.040
I thought the yukata were a good idea
since they both look and feel cool to wear.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:25.830
Yeah, that's the best part!

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:30.210
Customers ask me all the time
if I'm burning up in this outfit.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.250
How many times have you been asked, Rize?

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.960
Only twice so far this year.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.330
I'm up to four!

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:37.540
23 times for me.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.540
Tippy is the winner!

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.210
Maybe taking off the vest 
and ribbon will help a bit.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.880
"Chilled coffee"?

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:49.130
I wonder what makes it 
different from iced coffee?

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.330
Two chilled coffees, please!

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.460
So cold it's nearly frozen.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:57.210
Huh? Are you guys new employees here?

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.880
Where are Cocoa and the others?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:02.330
I don't see any pink, 
purple or blue anywhere.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:04.880
They only recognize us by color...

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.880
This stuff really is ice-cold.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.580
It seems that we can't go without our vests.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:17.880
It's important to stick 
to your signature color!

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:23.380
One of the appeals of Rabbit House
is the variety of color in the uniforms!

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.960
A variety of color...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.500
So, I guess we're sticking 
to these outfits like usua-

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.580
I have an idea!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.830
We can just make some!

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:31.460
Huh?

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.960
Make them ourselves?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:40.000
This is the time for the three of us
to combine our powers!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.250
U-uh, okay!

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.290
We're gonna cool things down!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:46.580
Let's give it our all and 
make new summer uniforms!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:48.290
Yeah!

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.790
You know, this cafe is...

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.710
...getting kind of stuffy!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.330
A summer uniform...!

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.580
Cocoa is already suffering heat fatigue.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.040
She burned fast and bright, huh?

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.580
We haven't even gotten to the store yet...

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.630
C'mon!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.790
Thanks.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.210
Let's start by finding short-sleeve 
shirts and casual skirts.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.670
Those we can just buy.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.130
Then we'll purchase some fabric
to make the vests oursel- ah!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.460
I knew you were just faking it!

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.630
That's not true...

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.250
If you're really not feeling well 
then I'll carry you. Hop on!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.210
No way! Not in front of Chino!

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.880
It feels wrong. It's too embarrassing.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.830
Your words and your actions 
aren't really lining up...

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.080
Sheesh, you really are hopeless.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.880
T-too heavy!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.540
I can't take both of you at once!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.330
Rize is all worn out now.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:04.540
It's because she really did 
carry us all the way here.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.580
We're not going to be able 
to take her through all that.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.330
No...

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.830
I still have the stamina to go on...

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.130
Oh no, Rize!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:38.080
I'm not done yet. I never 
retreat from any enemy!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.500
Syaro?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.170
Just stand back and leave it to me, Rize.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.710
This is my kind of battlefield!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:50.830
We need short-sleeve shirts... 
and skirts, please...

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.580
Roger!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.920
So dependable...

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.960
Oh, so you all came here, too?

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.130
Hey, Chiya!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.670
I see.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.880
You're here to get supplies
to make summer outfits for Rabbit House.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.170
I managed to get the shirts and skirts!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.330
Thanks, Syaro!

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.000
You were so powerful!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.580
That was some amazing fighting!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:27.040
I think it's really neat that you guys are working
together to make your own summer outfits.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.920
It seems so intimate, I'm jealous.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.330
Then you two should just make
your own matching outfits!

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.040
But I'm not interested 
in working at Ama Usa An.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:36.750
Huh?!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.250
Hold up! What's the problem?!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.540
Syaro, how could you?!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.330
Never a dull moment with them.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.500
Wow, this color is so pretty.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.960
I like this shade of blue, 
it's similar to my usual one.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.080
I found a really nice purple, too!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.000
There's no pink fabric...

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.000
Is it all sold out?

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.000
Oh my!
No way!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.080
That can't be the case!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.290
Cocoa isn't Cocoa without pink!

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.830
This is neon pink!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.290
This one has polka dots!

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:22.040
How about a low-key sequin fabric?

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.130
You're itching to attract attention, huh?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.380
Cocoa, you can't give up yet!

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.630
Let's go look at some other stores!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.710
Chino...

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.790
You're right!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.420
Are you okay, Chino?

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.250
Y-yeah, I'm just a little tired.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.460
Let's hurry to the next store.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.330
Don't push yourself.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:58.130
This sucks. No matter how many stores we visit,
we can't find the ideal pink!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:01.380
And summer will be over
by the time there's more in stock.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.420
What's this, Chino?

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.540
Oh! That's...

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:15.250
COCOA
PINK

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.920
I need some time to process this.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.040
This is super adorable!

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.500
Did you stay up late to draw this?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.710
That explains why you're so tired.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.540
Okay! Just leave it to your big sister!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.460
Don't be shy! Welcome come on!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.170
What does that even mean?!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.130
I got what I was after.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.960
Your summer vacation now belongs to me!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.580
Hold it, Phantom Thief Lapin!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.170
Give me back my summer vacation!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.460
There is nothing that I cannot steal!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.210
I changed my mind, put me down.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.380
Nuh-uh.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:08:00.040
But we have to hurry and 
find the best pink fabric.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.040
I don't like the idea of sequin, though.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.500
There's no reason to hurry!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.880
It's an easy job. We'll 
find it somewhere, no prob!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.540
Somewhere...

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.670
Yeah! Somewhere!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:13.670
Huh?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.080
What is it?

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:23.580
What are you doing in the storage room?

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:28.170
Well... I feel like I saw 
it in here once before.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.330
Saw what?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.290
A magic set!

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.830
No, that's not right.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.080
Why is there a magic set in here?

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.670
It's my mother's hobby.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.290
A toy rabbit!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.210
That's an old toy I used to play with my mom.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.710
I bought it for her.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.580
It certainly seems like this room
could use some organizing.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.960
Everything's a mess.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.000
Yeah...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:52.830
Found it!

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.210
Look! This is it!

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.420
I just knew it was somewhere 
in the storage room!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.250
Th-that's the perfect pink!

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.250
Your mom must have left that fabric behind.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:07.210
Now we can make a vest for Cocoa.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:14.290
Mommy! Thank you so much!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.380
It was my mom.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:19.290
C-Cocoa... look at the back!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.130
What's all this?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.880
Not an issue, it's reversible fabric.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.630
Okay, time to take some measurements!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.040
Yes, sir!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.130
Oh!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.380
I plan on having some nice curves in 10 years,
so make sure to give me some extra room!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.920
You're gonna wear it for 10 years?!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.790
Does that mean you plan 
to work here for 10 years?

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.420
I was just being silly.

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:47.380
W-well, unlike you, I 
take my future seriously.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.170
In 10 years from now...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.630
I wonder what kind of people we'll be?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.630
Well, let's see...

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:30.130
The storage room is full of 
junk, so I think we'll sell

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.110
some things off to a thrift store 
or at this year's brocante.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.040
At the flea market, huh?

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.580
That's a good idea.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.790
It's much better to unite things with people

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:41.740
who will take care of them, rather 
than let them sit and gather dust.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.880
Yep, that's right.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.500
Oh, it would be nice
if someone bought the demon rabbit.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.040
True, I wonder if someone will...

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.630
I was talking about you, Dad.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.500
What'd you call me?!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.580
Huh?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.750
Don't worry. I'll ask for a fortune.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:04.540
Today's Rabbit House is 
different from the usual!

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.250
Come and see us!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.790
I've lined up the goods!

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.380
I've deployed my troops!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.920
And I've put out my old clothes, too.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:18.830
We quit the coffee biz and made Rabbit House
into a knick-knack store!

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.710
We didn't quit coffee!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.880
The other stores are starting 
to get really busy.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.830
What's with the long faces?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.330
Will anyone... really want to buy this?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:42.250
I brought a bunch of stuff, 
but I guess it was pointless.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:44.830
C'mon, girls! You gotta smile!

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.460
Is this handmade? You're very talented!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.540
I'll buy some for my granddaughter.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.920
Oh, thank you so much!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.040
Great!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.750
Those are the smiles I like to see!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.830
W-we made a sale!

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.750
We certainly did.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:09.390
Um, we have a handle on things here.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:12.340
Please go around and take a 
look while you have a chance.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.250
Are you sure?

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:16.830
Of course! This is your first 
time at a brocante, right?

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.630
Yahoo!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.130
So many different things 
that pique my interest!

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:27.790
I could shop here for days!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.210
Oh? That's Chiya!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:32.750
Cocoa?!

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.380
Looks like you're having a great time!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.130
Well, this is all...

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.750
Chiya! I found another bargain!

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:42.880
Syaro?

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.080
Cocoa?!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.750
I got a little over excited...

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:51.790
Our little princess here just gets so enthusiastic
when she's at a brocante.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.540
Today is a day I meet 
with a lot of fine china!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.750
So I have to dress up a bit to match!

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.880
You certainly have an air of royalty!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.000
Okay, Chiya! It's time 
to visit the next place.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.380
Could we take a short break...?

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:07.330
Chiya?!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.920
My Royal Rabbit teacup!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.380
Such devotion!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.000
Syaro...

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.710
That cup means more to you than I do, huh?

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.750
Oh jeez, you're such a pain!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:23.880
FIRST COME FIRST SERVE
EMPORIUM

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.880
Step on up, folks! We've got
the best prices you've ever seen!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.170
That place is really booming!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.330
It's a discount store.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:31.000
They use things like smooth talking and haggling
to motivate people into buying their goods.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.830
That's one way of doing business.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.130
So cool!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.670
Do you think that I could do it?

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.210
Well, a typical pitchman usually has...

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.960
C'mon, give it a try before you buy!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.880
Shoot, I should have brought my paper fan!

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.290
You have one of those?

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.210
What?! You don't have your own paper fan?!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:50.920
Huh?!

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:53.750
That's an absolute must for 
any comedy duo like us.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:54.500
Not happening!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:57.960
I should get back to Chino and Rize soon.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.040
Huh? They came here today, too?

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.130
Where have they set up shop?

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.420
Just follow me.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.500
I'm sure Chino and Rize are making sales
with their great smiles!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.710
Too much doom and gloom!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.920
Oh dear.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.880
Everyone must think we're just selling junk.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.790
But it's all so lovely!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.000
"Lovely"...?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.040
You need to have a stronger pitch!

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:26.540
Let's show them! This is 
how sales really get made!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.210
Yeah!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.210
Looks more like a comedy routine!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.080
Welcome, Miss!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:36.920
This toy rabbit has quite 
the creative expression, no?

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:39.380
It exudes passion that 
the craftsman put in it.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.750
I can definitely see that.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.380
Okay, I'll take one!

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:44.960
Thank you!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:49.710
Only 100? At that price I'll be eating
bean sprout stir fry for dinner!

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.380
Okay, then 200!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.670
And sold!

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:56.500
You can't do their ultimate attack
unless you buy both in a set!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.460
Whoa! I'll buy it, I'll buy it!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.540
Much thanks!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.460
The three of them look 
absolutely radiant right now.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.080
Hard to believe being a cafe 
waitress is their day job...

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.000
Only part-time, though.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:10.170
All right! I'll do my best 
to draw in more customers!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.330
Wh-what am I supposed to do...?

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.170
Chino!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:19.040
We've got trouble! This 
girl lost track of her mom!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:19.540
What?!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:23.420
I'm going to try and find her!
Please watch after this girl for me, Chino!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:25.670
Huh? Wait, Rize...!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.580
P-please don't cry...

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.540
Um, let's see...

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.250
O-okay!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.330
Watch closely now!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.250
This magic cane can extend!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:58.790
Hopefully!

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.750
U-uh...

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:11.500
If you keep crying so much, your eyes
are going to start looking like a rabbit's.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.750
A rabbit...?

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:15.580
Th-that's right.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.000
Um...

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.080
Just like this!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.500
But its eyes aren't red.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.630
Y-you're right.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.210
A-actually, this rabbit 
can laugh all by itself.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.380
It's so weird!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.210
Yes, it is.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.040
Here, you can have it.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.750
Really?

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:51.210
Hey, Chino!

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:52.710
Rize!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.500
I found her!

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.460
Mommy!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.290
Thanks, Big Sis!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.540
"Big Sis"...

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.130
It's good that rabbit found a home, huh?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.580
Yes! She seemed to like it.

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.790
I think that girl will take good care of it.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.210
Yeah.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.750
That's a wrap, everyone!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.880
Good work today!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.580
Oh! This reminds me!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:43.670
I have presents for Chino and Rize,
since they kept watch over the shop.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.630
Oh? Thank you!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.170
I bought a bunch because 
they were really pretty!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.210
Doorknobs?!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:57.420
If you take a minute, it's not hard to figure out
why so much excess junk piles up around here.

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:58.830
That's the way it goes.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.500
Hey! Is that...?

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:05.000
I bought one of Rize's old t-shirts!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.170
Huh?!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:08.330
But it feels brand-new to me!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.880
I-I want one...

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.250
Were you going to buy some from me, too?

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.830
Um, no!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.630
Your clothes don't really, 
uh, come in my size...

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:22.170
Oh, well I actually have some smaller ones left over.
Are you interested?

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:28.880
Ah... this shirt smells just like her...

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.380
Syaro!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.880
Then I'll hand the clothes that 
don't fit me down to Chino!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.710
Th-they won't look good on me.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.790
Pink is totally your color, trust me!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.380
No, it's not.

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:51.130
See? You look great!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.670
Now give me some of your clothes, Chino.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.880
That would just turn this into a trade!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.540
Hey, Chino, I ran the numbers 
on our earnings today.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.830
Thank you.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:06.710
This is how it turned out!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.000
That's more profit than Rabbit 
House usually makes...

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.080
We're going to have to find a way
to draw more people to the cafe...

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.540
Don't get too frantic.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.130
Just leave it to me!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.960
Abracadabra

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:20.960
I'll use this to make the cafe more exciting!

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:24.540
The magic set? Did nobody buy that today?

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:28.170
Oh no, it sold. I bought it 
myself because I liked it!

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.080
Huh?

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.460
Today I learned that every 
object has its own history.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:37.210
So I want to create a new history
for all the tools in this magic set!

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.580
History...

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.080
Sure, have fun with it.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:47.040
Tippy gave his approval!
So time to get this show started!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.040
Ladies & ladies!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:52.960
Welcome to Cocoa's Magic Show Time!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.630
First up! Pay real close 
attention to this cane!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.580
A new history is about to unfold...

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.750
Maybe doves? Do you think 
doves will come out?

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.460
I'd like to see a lion, personally.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:04.790
It would eat us!

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:07.880
This cane will magically grow longer...

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.170
I made sure to read all the instructions...

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:20.000
Okay! I'll do another one!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.210
You've got me excited for this one!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:25.630
I'm sure that Cocoa won't fail 
to meet our expectations.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.540
Expectations of failure...

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.670
Please clap if I managed to make flowers
come out of my hat!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.960
Hocus-pocus!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:47.630
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:50.710
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.380
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:57.040
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:00.210
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.580
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)
They actually taste sweet, for real (Just kidding!)

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.670
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba
If we fly through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:09.790
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni
We can go anywhere together

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:15.920
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte (Arieru koto yori arienai koto)
Wanting to be a dreamer forever (More impossible than possible)

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:21.960
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite (Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)
Think about how exciting tomorrow will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.540
Sugar yori cinnamon ga
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:28.420
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo
If that becomes a preference, it might be time for evolution

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.790
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.830
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou
If you get invited there, let's take the plunge and fly

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.830
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)
(C'mon ride in the tea cup and soar through the sky)

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.040
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:43.790
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance (Dance dance!)
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:47.040
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance (Dance dance!)
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance (Dance dance)

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:50.710
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:53.330
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.710
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)
It doesn't really matter either way (Good point)

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:59.710
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)
A dollop of whip cream on your head (Fluff fluff)

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:05.830
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:09.330
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte
Flying through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.460
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!
We can go anywhere together!

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:21.880
Summer style!

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:26.380
How does it look? This 
is my new summer uniform!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:28.580
Very nice. It suits you.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:30.500
Yeah. It's not bad!

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:34.080
That's the exact same reaction you had
when I first wore the uniform here!

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:36.830
Was it really?

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:39.710
You two look great!

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:44.250
But... d-doesn't this design 
seem a little strange?

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.080
I'm not very confident about it.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:48.330
Looks good enough to wear for 10 years!

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:52.000
Well, once those 10 years are up,
I suppose we'll have Chino design another one.

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:54.880
Okay, time to get the cafe ready to open!

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:57.290
I'll liven up the place 
with more magic today!

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.500
H-hold on! Cocoa! Rize!

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:03.380
Huh?

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:05.500
What is it, Chino?

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:10.330
I look forward to... 
continuing to work with you!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:12.500
Same here!

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:13.630
Let's do it!

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:22.790
Let's all keep putting
our best foot forward together, Chino!

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:24.960
Right!

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:28.330
Feels like a long time 
since we last did this.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.040
I was getting sick of waiting!

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.420
I've been thinking, are there any people
out there who actually want to see the two of us?

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:36.000
Bunnisode 2: The Case of the 
Childhood Friend's Stolen Heart

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.920
Plenty of people want to see me!
